   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEED TO WEALTH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will empower rural women, youth, and men with access to sustainable skills that increase income, and employment to end hunger and poverty while reducing the impact of climate change.   Seed to Wealth will empower 100 beneficiaries in each selected community, providing them with fruit trees, crops, regenerative farming practices, and alternative skills like beekeeping, bag making, knitting, and crafts improve their living standard.</narrative>
